   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">GAP, FRANCE - JULY 16: Simon Geschke of Germany and Team Argos-Shimano descends whilst eating a ride snack during stage sixteen of the 2013 Tour de France, a 168KM road stage from Vaison-la-Romaine to Gap, on July 16, 2013 in Gap, France.  (Photo by Bryn Lennon/Getty Images)</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
