   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">INDIAN WELLS, CA - NOVEMBER 12:  Anna Leigh Waters and Catherine Parenteau take a hydration break against Lea Jansen and Vivienne David in the quarter finals of the Pro Womens Doubles division in the 2022 Margaritaville USA Pickleball Nationals Championships at Indian Wells Tennis Garden on November 12, 2022 in Indian Wells, California. (Photo by Bruce Yeung/Getty Images)</rdf:li>
